{"metadata":{"name":"Sahih al Bukhari","section":{"30":{"eng-name":"Fasting","ara-name":"كتاب الصوم"}},"section_detail":{"30":{"hadithnumber_first":1891,"hadithnumber_last":2007,"arabicnumber_first":1891,"arabicnumber_last":2007}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1940,"arabicnumber":1940,"text":"Rapporté par Thabit Al-Bunani : On a demandé à Anas bin Malik s’ils trouvaient la saignée déconseillée pour une personne qui jeûne. Il a répondu non et a dit : « Sauf si cela cause de la faiblesse. »","grades":[{"name":"Imam Bukhari","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":30,"hadith":47},"chapter":{"id":32,"ara-name":"باب الْحِجَامَةِ وَالْقَىْءِ لِلصَّائِمِ","eng-name":"Cupping and vomiting in Saum (fast)","isFirstHadith":false}}]}